      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "But if you will not hear these words, I swear by myself,” says the LORD, “that this house will become a desolation.”’”",
      "ko": "너희가 이 말을 듣지 아니하면 내가 나로 맹세하노니 이 집이 황무하리라 나 여호와의 말이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "9355dcc897d10e92971923aa121cfbf54de7741416f309e90f4effa650ee19cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "4af6f73285073f012cf5ff4fb90022cee4752b734d34dacba51402761bcdff97",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
