        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "But he will die in the place where they have led him captive. He will see this land no more.”",
      "ko": "잡혀간 곳에서 죽으리니 이 땅을 다시 보지 못하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "4fcb88edbb151fb56db1bf713850294c5cb0acb95230d8908fc6e22649b51897",
      "translation_text_hash": "feaaf6784468a9bad8feba77dbe578ba02635aa6b47ce41d3a40ee36faca6005",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
